WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.350
Two machines sit side by
side, fed the same two inputs,

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.810
A and B.

3
00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:11.650
The busy machine works out A AND B,
then combines that with A using OR.

4
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:15.030
The lazy machine just
passes A straight through.

5
00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:18.370
Inputs flash past, ones and zeros.

6
00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:21.010
Will the two machines ever disagree?

7
00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.870
In this mission, you'll
learn Boolean algebra,

8
00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:28.130
where OR is written as a
plus sign and AND as a dot.

9
00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:30.490
You'll test whether two
expressions are equal,

10
00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:34.090
by checking their outputs on
every row of a truth table.

11
00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:37.070
And you'll use rules that
make an expression shorter,

12
00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.270
without changing its truth table.

13
00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:44.310
Your mission: decide whether the busy machine
and the lazy machine ever give different

14
00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:45.040
outputs.
